, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =⟨2(-1),\\,(-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the cosine of the angle between $a$ and $b$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-5}{\\sqrt{(-2)^{2}+(-1)^{2}}\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot \\sqrt{10}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{5\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}})={135}^{∘}.\n$$" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305575 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305576 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305577 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305578 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305579 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1041 "selection" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305578 13194139534721 true] [17592186305574 1110 #uuid "b7d14433-e6bf-53f2-aba4-b6c9efded31e" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305575 1034 "{150}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305575 1111 #uuid "fe092e6a-a292-562a-8e10-3a18cf911c21" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305576 1034 "{90}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305576 1111 #uuid "9012605f-9225-5ab8-adaf-c6233a381fab" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305577 1034 "{180}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305577 1111 #uuid "cd96dcf2-df7b-5d7d-b63a-2f885d7a0ef4" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305578 1034 "{135}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305578 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [