}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-1)\\cdot 3+7\\cdot 6+0\\cdot (-1)}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{7}^{2}+{0}^{2}}\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{6}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{39}{\\sqrt{50}\\cdot \\sqrt{46}} \\\\  & =\\frac{39}{\\sqrt{2300}} \\\\  & =\\frac{39}{10\\sqrt{23}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{39}{10\\sqrt{23}})≈{35.6}^{∘}.\n$$" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305603 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305604 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305605 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305606 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305607 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1041 "selection" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305607 13194139534721 true] [17592186305602 1110 #uuid "cc72ad0a-0b50-5030-9cfb-302e160d3622" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305603 1034 "{45.3}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305603 1111 #uuid "6e5a51c2-e9bf-5c21-8013-39f0e3fa4759" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305604 1034 "{47.1}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305604 1111 #uuid "358ce25e-1f9a-5d75-a188-9f42822339ea" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305605 1034 "{42.3}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305605 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305605 1111 #uuid "b14bb041-b382-5f3d-8807-92d5f00ce59c" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305606 1034 "{31.7}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305606 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305606 1111 #uuid "ba3edf31-f02d-5254-8005-709d848b9be1" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305607 1034 "{35.6}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305607 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305607 1111 #uuid "f8b7063b-2074-5d0d-a432-d3066324f253" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1017 #edb/ref 17592186305609 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1089 "q-77167" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1100 "Consider the points $A(2t,4,3),$ $B(5t-1,4,3)$ and $C(2t+4,t+5,3).$ Find $∠BAC$ given that $\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot \\overset{\\to }{AC}=8.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1113 #uuid "e36ca8d6-b65d-5cd3-83a7-070f0b3504a8" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305608 1145 "Note that the position vectors of the points $A,$ $B$ and $C$ are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a=⟨2t,\\,4,\\,3⟩,\\,b=⟨5t-1,\\,4,\\,3⟩,\\,c=⟨2t+4,\\,t+5,\\,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe triangle $△ABC$ is shown (schematically) in the diagram below, where we denote $∠BAC=\\theta .$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040103/assets/285b8343208079181ac6036cf9ca16abc974d59b9262878ed40c0da9af5683d0.png)\n\nFirst, we find the components of $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =b-a \\\\  & =⟨5t-1,\\,4,\\,3⟩-⟨2t,\\,4,\\,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3t-1,\\,0,\\,0⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =c-a \\\\  & =⟨2t+4,\\,t+5,\\,3⟩-⟨2t,\\,4,\\,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,t+1,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot \\overset{\\to }{AC}=8,$ we can solve for $t,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =8 \\\\ (3t-1)\\cdot 4+0\\cdot (t+1)+0\\cdot 0 & =8 \\\\ 4(3t-1)+0+0 & =8 \\\\ 12t-4 & =8 \\\\ 12t & =12 \\\\ t & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨2,0,0⟩, \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =⟨4,\\,2,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, the cosine of the angle between $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot \\overset{\\to }{AC}}{|\\overset{\\to }{AB}||\\overset{\\to }{AC}|} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{20}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{80}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{4\\sqrt{5}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}})≈{26.57}^{∘}.\n$$" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305610 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305611 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305612 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305613 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305614 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1041 "selection" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305613 13194139534721 true] [17592186305609 1110 #uuid "43f81a4f-4f23-590d-a87a-a991a42d8c5e" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305610 1034 "{63.43}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305610 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305610 1111 #uuid "6d72837a-6c83-5f35-929e-ffa5344f19be" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305611 1034 "{21.42}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305611 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305611 1111 #uuid "f974f885-0f17-5500-a7fe-b3bd99079839" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305612 1034 "{77.07}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305612 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305612 1111 #uuid "c52c118f-55a2-5a15-92a7-015727f1d9f4" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305613 1034 "{26.57}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305613 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534721 true] [17592186305613 1111 #uuid "38a10d4d-48eb-58bc-ab1d-69d971c1060c" 13194139534721 true] [17592186305614 1034 "{10.52}^{∘}" 13194139534721 true]